// BaselScript function definitions
//
// Format:
// canonical;aliases;arity;requirement
//
// aliases:
//   zero or more names separated by |
//
// arity:
//   *       = legacy runtime has no migrated parameter-count rule yet
//   2       = exactly 2 parameters
//   2|4     = exactly 2 or 4 parameters
//   1..3    = from 1 to 3 parameters
//   2..*    = at least 2 parameters
//   *..2    = at most 2 parameters
//
// requirement:
//   None
//   ApplicationDatabase
//   Canvas
//
// Function names are case-sensitive.

